ection><section class="block pricing" id="pricing"><div class="wrap"><h2>Book ahead or get help now</h2><p class="section-intro">Choose a scheduled appointment for a lower rate, or request the next available technician. Pay only for the minutes used on a successful repair.</p><div class="price-table-wrap"><table class="price-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Specialty</th><th scope="col">Book a time</th><th scope="col">On demand</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Personal technology</th><td><strong>$36</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$0.60/min</small></td><td><strong>$60</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.00/min</small></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Business software</th><td><strong>$48</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$0.80/min</small></td><td><strong>$84</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.40/min</small></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Advanced IT</th><td><strong>$72</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.20/min</small></td><td><strong>$108</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.80/min</small></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">AI & automation</th><td><strong>$96</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$1.60/min</small></td><td><strong>$144</strong><span>/hr</span><small>$2.40/min</small></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="price-footer"><span>All rates billed by the minute.</span><a href="/contact/">Request tech help →</a></div></div><div class="guarantee"><div><h3>No fix, no fee</h3></div><p>We agree on the problem and rate before starting. If we cannot resolve the agreed repair issue, you pay nothing. For AI implementation, training and other project work, we agree on a specific deliverable and billing terms upfront.</p></div><p class="note">Planned launch rates. Inquiries are welcome; appointments and immediate support are not yet available.</p></div></section><section class="block research"><div class="wrap research-grid"><div><h2>Technology, understood through data</h2><p class="section-intro">Our research program will examine how technology affects Arizona households, businesses and communities, using public data and transparent methods.</p><a class="plain" href="/research/">Explore our research program →</a></div><div class="research-graphic"><strong>Arizona first.<br/>National perspective.</strong><p>Digital safety · AI adoption · Internet access · Business technology</p></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>A simpler way to get help</h2><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Tell us what you need</h3><p>Describe the problem so we can identify the right expertise.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Choose your time</h3><p>Book ahead or request immediate help when a technician is available.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Pay for time used</h3><p>Approve the scope and rate first. Our planned repair guarantee is no fix, no fee for eligible issues.</p></div></div></div></section></Base>